    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>Heat gathers behind your teeth. You open your mouth, and a low stream of flame races across the ground.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Main Action</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>Fortitude</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Every creature in three contiguous squares in a straight line beginning adjacent to you.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Attack / Control</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Make a Fortitude line spell attack.</p><dl class=\"hol-reference-outcomes\"><dt>Weak</dt><dd>3 fire damage.</dd><dt>Standard</dt><dd>3 fire damage and Burning 1.</dd><dt>Strong</dt><dd>5 fire damage and Burning 1.</dd></dl></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4/design/cards/breath-of-the-wyrmling.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/breath-of-the-wyrmling.md</a> at <code>f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4</code>.</p></section>",
